    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Paradise, home to the winners of Kawai'i's Beauty Pageant! I think? How'd we get here... Play as Mayumi, the winner, armed with your one way ticket to the resort! Sneak around the puzzling halls of Paradise and explore your cherished memories of Kawai'i in all its beauty. It's all so perfect! W\u0334\u0352\u0339h\u0334\u034c\u0331a\u0336\u030d\u0316t\u0338\u0303\u0316'\u0338\u0303\u0348s\u0335\u0340\u0320 e\u0337\u0311ven real? Player discretion advised. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Narrative &quot;Walking Simulator&quot; Adventure</u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful 3d environments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about Kawai'i's characters </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Survival Horror</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak around Paradise, avoiding getting caught </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the darkness with nothing but your lighter </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and Discover Paradise's truth </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS GAME IS NOT MEANT FOR CHILDREN</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mature Content Description: \u2028Gore, body horror, explicit language (edited)</i></p>",
